      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an overwhelming sense of guilt and displacement due to your family's struggles. While these heavy feelings can make it hard to breathe, please remember that your presence does not indefinitely steal from others, and your worth is not measurable by what you might \"have taken.\" You are loved, needed, and personally responsible only for your own life; please reach out for support when you feel like the struggle is becoming too much to bear alone.",
